  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "Now, you\u2019ll test your Flythrough mode skills to go through
      the course again. \n\nYou can actually get anywhere you want in a scene using
      Flythrough mode. With more practice, you\u2019ll eventually settle into your
      own 3D navigation style, likely using a combination of Flythrough mode and
      Frame, Orbit, Zoom."
